      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is a problem here, as we\u0027ll be missing the `DENY` condition.\n\n`DENY` rules work by not adding the `ALLOW`, see the comment at `PermissionCollection.java:219`:\n\n```java\n        if (pr.getAction() \u003d\u003d PermissionRule.Action.DENY) {\n          // DENY rules work by not adding ALLOW rules. Nothing else to do.\n          continue;\n        }\n```\n\nIf I define an explicit `DENY` rule saying I don\u0027t want a branch reviewed by AI, it would be considered irrelevant and granted anyway.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 197,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 197,
        "endChar": 60
      },
      "revId": "262c5df2b91ee8fcca6bc9715fce3509cbfe11d0",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
