      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-18T22:22:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "there is a problem with the fact that by default we want to preserve the existing behaviour: enabling the experiment grants it to everyone... AFAIU that is not what is supported natively in Gerrit where permission is granted only when `ALLOW` is specified up in the hierarchy. So I believe it boils down to two options:\n1. if we want to stick to the existing Gerrit\u0027s behaviour then we need to `ALLOW` it somewhere in the hierarchy and `DENY`/`BLOCK` below\n2. develop temporary grant-by-default and ALOW/DENY/BLOCK as we have now in the chain...\n\nWDYT?",
